			"id": "gs9_swrt_total_detail",
			"name": "SWRT total with Detail Tracing",
			"gates": ["GS-9"],
			"status": "report_only",
			"reason": "GS-9's detail-mode cost is reported with the UE ratio, not judged (plan §23.6). GodotNext uses software_ray_tracing_mode = detail at High; UE uses r.Lumen.TraceMeshSDFs 1. The GodotNext group is the NextGI frame block without the closing marker and line 1b. The UE group adds GPU/GlobalDistanceFieldUpdate, GPU/LumenSceneUpdate and GPU/UpdateLumenSceneBuffers to Lumen Scene Lighting, Lumen Screen Probe Gather and Lumen Reflections; GPU/DistanceFields stays out because it is also busy without Lumen and its GodotNext counterpart is not settled.",
